WEBVTT

00:06.006 --> 00:09.467
[sweet airy music]

00:43.460 --> 00:44.586
[Ung] When I was in school,

00:44.669 --> 00:46.838
there was this gift shop nearby,
and the owner had a dog.

00:49.340 --> 00:51.342
I think his name was Jjongjjong.

00:54.053 --> 00:55.388
Let's see.

00:55.472 --> 00:58.683
- Excuse me, sir, how much is this?
- Oh, 500 won.

00:58.767 --> 01:00.060
- [boy] This one too?
- Mm-hmm.

01:01.144 --> 01:03.897
There's another kind you can fly
instead of that ball there.

01:03.980 --> 01:06.024
[Ung] Jjongjjong seemed detached.

01:06.775 --> 01:09.235
- [light music]
- Oh.

01:10.361 --> 01:11.529
Hi, sir, where are you going?

01:12.822 --> 01:14.699
[shop owner] I'm taking
Jjongjjong for a walk.

01:14.783 --> 01:16.451
It looks to me like
you're the only one walking.

01:16.534 --> 01:17.702
[chuckles]

01:17.786 --> 01:20.413
You see, Jjongjjong likes to be cuddled.
[chuckles]

01:20.497 --> 01:21.623
See you, bye.

01:23.374 --> 01:24.417
[humming happily]

01:25.627 --> 01:27.921
[Ung] He practically
treated his dog like a king.

01:28.004 --> 01:29.631
WITH UNG

01:29.714 --> 01:31.925
- Hi, nice to see you, Ung.
- Hi, how are you?

01:32.509 --> 01:33.468
Huh?

01:34.636 --> 01:36.679
I didn't know you just had a baby.

01:39.933 --> 01:42.101
[Ung] It seemed to me
like his life was amazing.

01:42.602 --> 01:44.979
You know what? I don't think
I've ever seen his feet touch the ground.

01:45.063 --> 01:47.232
He runs around like crazy at home, though.

01:47.857 --> 01:49.943
When I grow up,
my dream is to live like Jjongjjong.

01:51.694 --> 01:53.738
Ung, to tell you the truth,

01:54.322 --> 01:56.741
when Jjongjjong was a puppy,
he was actually abandoned.

01:56.825 --> 01:58.993
- So he's afraid of the outdoors.
- Really?

01:59.077 --> 02:01.204
Maybe he was abandoned outside.

02:01.287 --> 02:02.872
That's why he acts like that.

02:04.666 --> 02:07.460
[shop owner] Imagine being abandoned
at your happiest moment…

02:07.544 --> 02:09.212
He must have been so scared.

02:09.295 --> 02:11.381
[light music continues]

02:13.758 --> 02:15.176
[Ung] So the reason… 

02:16.052 --> 02:18.304
why I'm suddenly
talking about this is because…

02:18.388 --> 02:19.681
I'm not going, sir.

02:19.764 --> 02:21.558
But why? I really don't get it.

02:21.641 --> 02:23.852
I'm grateful for this opportunity,

02:24.435 --> 02:27.105
- but it's too far, and it's just too long.
- Stop being ridiculous.

02:27.188 --> 02:29.149
When you went there
to study for six months,

02:29.232 --> 02:31.818
I could clearly see how much
your skills drastically improved.

02:31.901 --> 02:33.528
Back then I only stayed six months.

02:34.112 --> 02:36.656
Living there
for several years is different.

02:36.739 --> 02:39.367
Besides, I don't wanna go there alone.

02:39.450 --> 02:41.244
[scoffs]
My goodness.

02:41.995 --> 02:43.788
I'll cancel my recommendation then.

02:43.872 --> 02:44.747
[clears throat]

02:48.501 --> 02:49.377
But…

02:51.129 --> 02:52.922
If that's the reason why…

02:53.882 --> 02:56.885
you don't want to go, then you can
bring your friend along with you.

02:58.052 --> 02:59.304
[teacher groans]

03:03.516 --> 03:05.560
[cheery music]

03:05.643 --> 03:06.519
ENGLAND STUDY ABROAD

03:06.603 --> 03:08.646
What else do I need?
My GPA won't be an issue.

03:08.730 --> 03:09.981
English scores? TOEFL?

03:10.064 --> 03:12.150
I can get that. No problem.
I study a lot you know.

03:12.233 --> 03:14.736
What about financial support?
Stipends? You know any scholarship?

03:14.819 --> 03:16.195
What about living expenses, huh?

03:16.279 --> 03:17.947
[both groan]

03:18.656 --> 03:22.744
If I bring this up to Yeon-su right now,
I'm sure she'll just tell me to go alone.

03:22.827 --> 03:24.329
But I can't do that, it's too long.

03:24.412 --> 03:26.331
Listen, do you wanna take Yeon-su?

03:26.414 --> 03:27.498
I'm game. You can take me.

03:27.582 --> 03:28.875
I did some research.

03:28.958 --> 03:31.044
There are a lot of schools
that Yeon-su could easily go to.

03:31.127 --> 03:32.086
[scoffs]

03:32.170 --> 03:34.547
She has a high GPA,
which is a really good thing.

03:35.757 --> 03:37.300
I'm thinking that it'd be great

03:37.383 --> 03:39.677
for the two of us
to go abroad and study together.

03:40.428 --> 03:41.262
[sighs]

03:41.346 --> 03:42.889
I really wanted to be your manager.

03:43.514 --> 03:46.267
But I can't stop you
because it's such a good opportunity.

03:47.101 --> 03:49.103
Anyway, you two
are going to live together?

03:50.188 --> 03:53.066
Are you serious?
Of course we'll stay in dorms…

03:55.944 --> 03:56.778
Do you think we can?

03:56.861 --> 03:59.364
If you're both going there,
don't you think you should live together?

03:59.447 --> 04:01.157
[Eun-ho] You'd be going
to a different country.

04:02.075 --> 04:04.244
You need to rely on each other there.

04:05.411 --> 04:07.580
[chuckles]
You look so excited.

04:07.664 --> 04:09.916
Wasn't that what you were thinking
in the first place?

04:09.999 --> 04:14.295
Hey, of course not. This is a decision
I'm considering solely for our future.

04:14.379 --> 04:15.588
[deep inhale]

04:15.672 --> 04:17.423
And I still have to ask Yeon-su first.

04:21.427 --> 04:22.470
[chuckles happily]

04:23.471 --> 04:25.515
[sorrowful music]

04:30.061 --> 04:31.187
Why are you doing this?

04:36.276 --> 04:37.443
[Ung] What's your reason?

04:41.739 --> 04:43.241
Why do we have to break up?

04:47.161 --> 04:49.038
[shouting]
Why do we have to break up, Yeon-su?

04:53.418 --> 04:55.461
[muted crying]

05:02.844 --> 05:04.887
[sorrowful music continues]

05:09.892 --> 05:11.144
[music fades]

05:18.818 --> 05:22.030
Oh. I'm sorry. What was I talking about?

05:22.989 --> 05:24.657
Right. Jjongjjong.

05:30.079 --> 05:32.123
- [soft music]
- [groans]

05:37.670 --> 05:41.049
I've been thinking
a lot about him recently.

05:41.716 --> 05:44.635
About the way he's decided
to cope with his trauma.

05:44.719 --> 05:48.431
See that? We can really
be friends after all.

05:50.141 --> 05:51.517
[Ung] I know it seems pathetic…

05:58.775 --> 06:01.027
[uplifting music]

06:06.491 --> 06:10.119
…but I'm… acting like Jjongjjong now.

06:12.205 --> 06:14.332
[uplifting music continues]

06:22.048 --> 06:24.425
Honestly, I'm not sure if I can face it.

06:25.301 --> 06:27.553
I can't handle
something I can't bear again.

06:31.599 --> 06:35.937
That's why… I'm choosing
the same method as Jjongjjong.

06:38.189 --> 06:39.440
Because nothing will happen…

06:40.441 --> 06:42.527
if I just stay here and do nothing.

06:43.361 --> 06:50.368
EPISODE 11: OUR NIGHTS
ARE MORE BEAUTIFUL THAN YOUR DAYS

06:51.911 --> 06:53.204
[Ji-ung] Did you get home safely?

06:58.126 --> 06:59.210
[Yeon-su] Of course.


06:59.293 --> 07:01.879
You practically pushed me
inside the front door, remember?

07:01.963 --> 07:03.881
[Ji-ung] Thanks for staying with me today.

07:03.965 --> 07:06.175
And for putting up with my boring stories.

07:12.765 --> 07:14.851
[gentle music]

07:16.269 --> 07:17.770
[Yeon-su] You can call me anytime.

07:18.646 --> 07:20.648
[gentle music continues]

07:36.164 --> 07:37.707
[Ji-ung] You stopped by my place today?

07:49.343 --> 07:51.554
WE SPOTTED THE ARTIST GO-OH
SECRETLY MEETING NJ

08:02.440 --> 08:05.193
[NJ] Aren't we releasing a statement
refuting the article?

08:05.276 --> 08:07.195
We don't need to deal with that rumor.

08:08.529 --> 08:10.323
But that's what we've
always done in the past.

08:10.406 --> 08:13.284
That's right, but back then
you were seeing mostly lousy scumbags.

08:13.367 --> 08:14.368
[NJ] I don't get it.

08:14.452 --> 08:17.163
When I was actually dating those guys,
you would always rush in

08:17.246 --> 08:18.998
and deny those relationships
with the press.

08:19.081 --> 08:21.083
But now that I'm not dating Ung,
you won't even deny it?

08:21.167 --> 08:23.794
The thing is,
compared to your former dating scandals,

08:23.878 --> 08:26.506
the public's response
to this one isn't so negative.

08:26.589 --> 08:28.674
[CEO] Also he has
a pretty good reputation too.

08:29.300 --> 08:31.594
CEO KANG YEON-JU

08:31.677 --> 08:35.223
Besides, you said
you felt like you were suffocating.

08:36.766 --> 08:39.060
If you can breathe better
when you're next to him,

08:39.143 --> 08:40.520
then I can turn a blind eye.

08:40.603 --> 08:42.438
You can see him and let off some steam,

08:42.522 --> 08:44.440
just don't let it
interfere with your work.

08:46.108 --> 08:47.693
[scoffs]

08:52.073 --> 08:55.076
Are you hoping this will pass over
like it did all the other times?

08:56.244 --> 08:58.663
You better stop treating me
like I'm still a little kid.

08:58.746 --> 08:59.872
[scoffs]

08:59.956 --> 09:01.332
You're too young to know how to--

09:01.415 --> 09:03.834
Do you think I see him
just so I can feel better?

09:03.918 --> 09:05.253
Isn't it obvious from the photo?

09:05.336 --> 09:07.505
Can't you tell that
I'm the only one who has feelings?

09:07.588 --> 09:09.757
[NJ] Seeing him more
would only stress me out.

09:09.840 --> 09:12.927
So stop making stupid plans about us,
and I want you to leave him alone.

09:13.010 --> 09:15.513
He's not like some candy
you can throw at me.

09:15.596 --> 09:16.806
YEON ENTERTAINMENT

09:16.889 --> 09:19.475
Remember this,
he has nothing to do with my actions.

09:23.145 --> 09:25.147
[Eun-ho] "It would also appear that NJ

09:25.231 --> 09:28.818
would visit this artist at his home
whenever she had any free time."

09:28.901 --> 09:33.114
"The two would frequently
enjoy a meal at their favorite restaurant

09:33.197 --> 09:34.699
before going to her house."

09:36.284 --> 09:37.577
Her house?

09:38.578 --> 09:41.706
Funny, right, Ung?
They're claiming you went to her house.

09:42.290 --> 09:45.710
You and NJ, her house, it doesn't add up.

09:47.003 --> 09:49.547
But then… take a look at this.

09:50.131 --> 09:52.216
Wow, that looks like
you're standing in front of her house.

09:52.300 --> 09:53.884
This is crazy, isn't it? Right?

09:53.968 --> 09:55.219
Wait. You see this?

09:56.012 --> 09:57.221
And there's more. Wow.

09:57.305 --> 09:59.473
This shot looks like
it was taken by paparazzi.

09:59.557 --> 10:00.891
It's so interesting, don't you think?

10:00.975 --> 10:02.560
Come on. Stop.

10:03.477 --> 10:04.562
There's more…

10:05.396 --> 10:06.856
Check my phone, hmm?

10:06.939 --> 10:08.608
Since I became your manager,

10:08.691 --> 10:10.610
this is my first time
to put my phone on silent mode.

10:10.693 --> 10:13.779
Ung, you have to give me something
if you expect me to answer all of them.

10:13.863 --> 10:15.531
You wouldn't answer
any of my calls earlier.

10:15.615 --> 10:16.907
So what do you want me to do?

10:16.991 --> 10:18.534
Where did I leave my phone?

10:19.076 --> 10:19.910
First of all…

10:22.163 --> 10:23.706
- tell me everything.
- What do I tell you?

10:23.789 --> 10:25.958
- Tell me it's not true.
- It's not.

10:27.084 --> 10:28.002
Really?

10:28.669 --> 10:30.338
All right, then. Good.

10:30.421 --> 10:31.672
It's fine if it's not the truth.

10:31.756 --> 10:34.884
I mean, it's all fake news. Right, Ung?
When I was reading it,

10:34.967 --> 10:37.178
it didn't make any sense.
What they said was impossible.

10:37.261 --> 10:39.597
Can you imagine?
People actually believe this shit.

10:39.680 --> 10:41.932
Goodness. It's ridiculous. There's no way.

10:42.016 --> 10:44.018
So, can you tell them that…

10:44.935 --> 10:48.814
we're not dating and that I… um,

10:48.898 --> 10:50.149
I'm just a fan of NJ.

10:51.984 --> 10:53.110
[sighs]

10:53.194 --> 10:56.238
This must be such
a huge hassle for NJ, right?

10:56.322 --> 10:57.698
She helped us so much,

10:57.782 --> 10:59.950
but all we did in return
was ruin her reputation.

11:00.034 --> 11:02.453
[clicks tongue, sighs]

11:02.536 --> 11:04.372
Hey, where did I leave my phone?

11:05.081 --> 11:07.583
Why are you asking me?
I just got here. I haven't seen it.

11:07.667 --> 11:09.835
I'm sure you shoved it
somewhere in your studio.

11:17.927 --> 11:19.053
[Ung] There it is.

11:22.890 --> 11:24.100
- [gasps]
- MISSED CALL, GU EUN-HO

11:25.726 --> 11:26.769
GU EUN-HO, FATHER, NJ

11:28.521 --> 11:29.438
[line trills]

11:30.689 --> 11:32.233
[phone buzzing]

11:35.486 --> 11:36.737
[clears throat, soft chuckle]

11:39.532 --> 11:42.868
Hello, Mr. Artist. I'm guessing
you lost your phone and just found it.

11:42.952 --> 11:45.371
- Am I right?
- [Ung] Oh. Well, how did you know that?

11:45.454 --> 11:47.248
[NJ] I think I know you a bit better now.

11:47.873 --> 11:48.791
[groans]

11:49.500 --> 11:52.628
[Ung] I just saw the article about us.
I'm so sorry.

11:53.129 --> 11:55.423
I never thought
people would make it into a big issue.

11:55.506 --> 11:57.800
I think I caused
a lot of trouble for you, NJ.

11:58.592 --> 12:01.011
You got it wrong. You're the one
who might be in real trouble.

12:03.139 --> 12:05.808
I think my agency
might not refute the article.

12:05.891 --> 12:07.143
[NJ] I guess they did the math

12:07.226 --> 12:09.895
and realized that I have something
to gain from all this.

12:09.979 --> 12:12.356
Sadly, they're trying
to take advantage of your good image.

12:12.440 --> 12:14.483
So you better tell everyone
that it's not true.

12:14.567 --> 12:16.444
Tell them I'm the one chasing you around.

12:16.527 --> 12:18.946
It's time for you
to teach my agency a lesson.

12:20.156 --> 12:23.325
Hang on. I'm not sure
I understand what you're saying,

12:23.409 --> 12:25.494
but wouldn't it be bad for you
if I do that?

12:25.578 --> 12:26.412
[sighs]

12:26.495 --> 12:30.207
On a day like this I feel like I should
meet up with you so we could celebrate.

12:30.291 --> 12:32.501
After all, it's your first dating scandal.

12:34.211 --> 12:37.298
But unfortunately,
my schedule is too packed right now.

12:37.882 --> 12:39.717
[NJ] I'll just call you again next time.

12:39.800 --> 12:40.801
Bye.

12:44.138 --> 12:45.222
[inhales]

12:46.515 --> 12:48.017
[sighs deeply]

12:48.100 --> 12:50.227
That's right. He's a huge fan of NJ.

12:51.353 --> 12:54.815
What? A stalker fan?
Hey, what are you trying to say?

12:55.900 --> 12:57.735
Why on earth
would he follow her to her house?

12:57.818 --> 12:59.945
No, I mean, that's not what happened here.

13:01.030 --> 13:03.407
How dare you
talk about him like that, you idiot!

13:04.700 --> 13:05.743
What do you think you're doing?

13:06.243 --> 13:08.037
Just ignore them.
Don't talk to them anymore.

13:08.579 --> 13:09.747
Why not?

13:10.498 --> 13:12.541
I think we should wait
until they release a statement.

13:12.625 --> 13:13.584
Let's not get involved.

13:15.336 --> 13:16.712
Why are you changing your mind?

13:18.964 --> 13:20.132
[Eun-ho] Hey, wait.

13:20.216 --> 13:24.303
You didn't make some kind of agreement
with NJ about the article, or did you?

13:24.929 --> 13:26.555
Wow. You're unbelievable, Ung.

13:26.639 --> 13:29.683
Tell me, how close are you to NJ
that you could just…

13:29.767 --> 13:30.768
[groans]

13:31.393 --> 13:33.604
I swear, I never thought
it would come to this.

13:33.687 --> 13:35.231
You need to be honest with me.

13:36.774 --> 13:38.526
What's going on between you two?

13:38.609 --> 13:41.779
Shut up. What does my schedule
look like this week?

13:42.905 --> 13:45.407
You're acting so strange.
You're not the Ung I know.

13:45.491 --> 13:47.493
You're not Choi Ung, are you?
Give him back, now.

13:47.576 --> 13:49.870
Will you quit it with all that nonsense?

13:51.038 --> 13:52.373
This week you're busy.

13:52.456 --> 13:54.500
You have rescheduled interviews, remember?

13:54.583 --> 13:56.252
Plus, you also have documentary shoots.

13:56.335 --> 13:58.837
By the way, Friday is gonna be
the last day of filming.

13:58.921 --> 14:01.048
Yeon-su will be joining us
on that day too.

14:02.299 --> 14:03.300
[Eun-ho sighs]

14:03.384 --> 14:05.386
So it's finally coming to an end, I guess.

14:06.345 --> 14:07.263
[sighs]

14:08.430 --> 14:10.432
[gentle music]

14:16.564 --> 14:18.941
[breathing heavily]

14:21.944 --> 14:24.029
[panting]

14:33.163 --> 14:35.374
[breathing heavily]

14:41.755 --> 14:44.383
[gentle music continues]

14:50.931 --> 14:52.016
[sighs]

15:03.110 --> 15:04.445
[chomps]

15:08.032 --> 15:10.284
[Yeon-ok] It's a good thing
Ung got to deliver it to you.

15:10.367 --> 15:11.577
Don't forget to heat it up.

15:11.660 --> 15:13.996
Hmm? That's very good.

15:14.079 --> 15:15.915
Tell me if there's anything else you want.

15:16.749 --> 15:18.792
I made all your favorite dishes,

15:18.876 --> 15:21.086
and I'll make some more
if that's not enough.

15:21.170 --> 15:23.631
[chuckles]
Oh, is that so?

15:24.214 --> 15:26.342
All right, Ji-ung,
you should get back to work.

15:26.425 --> 15:29.053
Okay. I will see you soon. Bye.

15:29.970 --> 15:31.764
My goodness, what a brat.

15:31.847 --> 15:34.850
I really don't know why he has a phone
when he doesn't bother picking up.

15:34.934 --> 15:37.311
Oh, my. Why do you keep calling Ung?

15:37.394 --> 15:39.897
Just leave him alone. He must be sleeping.

15:39.980 --> 15:42.316
He's not. He says he can't sleep well.
[sighs]

15:42.399 --> 15:45.069
Maybe his meds are finally working.
If so, that's a good thing.

15:45.152 --> 15:49.114
Darn it. Even so, that foolish boy
better give us a call soon

15:49.198 --> 15:51.075
because my curiosity is killing me.

15:52.159 --> 15:54.203
By the way, do you really think

15:54.286 --> 15:58.207
there's something going on between
our son and that celebrity who came here?

15:58.290 --> 16:00.709
Leave him alone.
I'm sure he'll take care of it.

16:00.793 --> 16:02.711
He said they're only friends,
so they must be.

16:02.795 --> 16:04.254
- And besides…
- Mm?

16:06.465 --> 16:09.093
Our son already has Yeon-su,
you know that.

16:09.176 --> 16:10.886
- Yeon-su?
- Mm-hmm.

16:11.512 --> 16:14.640
Are you saying that, something
is going on between those two again?

16:14.723 --> 16:16.684
I thought they decided
they were going to be friends.

16:16.767 --> 16:18.227
[clicks tongue]
I don't know.

16:18.310 --> 16:20.062
I think they'll eventually
end up together.

16:20.896 --> 16:22.314
Yeon-su…

16:23.232 --> 16:27.111
Hmm. I agree. When it comes to Ung,
Yeon-su is the perfect girl.

16:27.194 --> 16:29.029
- Right.
- Yes, of course.

16:29.113 --> 16:31.573
- Of course, it's true.
- [chuckles]

16:32.199 --> 16:34.910
My goodness. Fall is already here.

16:34.994 --> 16:36.203
Oh, that's right.

16:36.286 --> 16:39.123
NOW SERVING GIZZARDS,
GRILLED OR SEASONED

16:39.957 --> 16:41.959
[soft music]

16:43.711 --> 16:44.837
Is it this week?

16:51.218 --> 16:55.014
We should tell Ung that
we're going to visit the countryside.

16:55.097 --> 16:56.056
Hmm.

16:57.975 --> 17:00.060
[soft music continues]

17:04.815 --> 17:06.567
[breathes heavily]

17:09.278 --> 17:10.529
[sighs]

17:12.573 --> 17:13.741
INCOMING CALL
SOL-I

17:16.535 --> 17:18.454
- Hey.
- [Sol-i] Where are you?

17:18.537 --> 17:21.165
I just finished a meeting.
I'm heading back to the office right now.

17:21.248 --> 17:24.710
- [Yeon-su] Why?
- Oh, nothing. Well, you know…

17:24.793 --> 17:27.129
I'm hanging up if this is nothing.
I'm driving.

17:28.422 --> 17:29.673
So are they really dating?

17:29.757 --> 17:31.216
- Choi Ung and NJ.
- [Yeon-su] I'm hanging up.

17:31.800 --> 17:33.677
Hey! Watch your temper.

17:33.761 --> 17:36.555
- You didn't ask him about it, did you?
- Why should I even ask him?

17:36.638 --> 17:37.723
[sighs]

17:37.806 --> 17:40.684
I know you're hurting yourself by
imagining all sorts of things right now.

17:40.768 --> 17:42.644
Who? Me? Nope, not at all.

17:42.728 --> 17:43.937
I'm too busy working right now

17:44.021 --> 17:46.106
to think about useless things
that don't concern me.

17:46.690 --> 17:48.692
- You said you're driving.
- Goodbye.

17:51.945 --> 17:52.863
[clears throat]

18:06.543 --> 18:08.629
[cheeky music]

18:10.547 --> 18:13.383
[window whirring]

18:17.387 --> 18:19.056
She's not Ung's type.

18:20.808 --> 18:21.975
She's pretty, but…

18:23.102 --> 18:25.270
Mm-hmm, she's pretty, but…

18:26.063 --> 18:27.773
Her smile's a bit…

18:27.856 --> 18:28.982
[chuckles]

18:30.484 --> 18:32.861
And she's way too young for him.

18:34.404 --> 18:36.198
- [car honking]
- [gasps]

18:38.450 --> 18:40.869
[music fades]

18:42.871 --> 18:45.415
Oh, Ji-ung,
what happened to you yesterday?

18:45.499 --> 18:48.961
Oh, sorry. Something came up.
Did you wait for me?

18:49.044 --> 18:50.712
It's okay, I had work to do anyway.

18:50.796 --> 18:52.881
But Mr. Choi was here,
and he waited for you.

18:55.425 --> 18:56.426
Ung was here yesterday?

18:56.510 --> 18:59.054
Yes, I told him you were coming back soon,

18:59.138 --> 19:01.598
so he waited in the editing room
for quite some time.

19:01.682 --> 19:03.016
I think he came here
to bring you some food.

19:08.147 --> 19:10.983
It was your birthday, right?
Happy birthday.

19:11.066 --> 19:13.652
Mr. Park wanted to throw you a party,
but I stopped him.

19:13.735 --> 19:16.446
Good job, thanks. You're so sharp
when it comes to those things.

19:17.322 --> 19:19.700
- You got a to shoot?
- Mr. Choi is going to do an interview

19:19.783 --> 19:21.368
so I'm heading out to shoot that.

19:21.451 --> 19:22.411
[Chae-ran] Ji-ung.

19:23.871 --> 19:27.416
In case I come back early after the shoot
and you have free time after work,

19:27.499 --> 19:28.917
please let me take you out to dinner.

19:29.001 --> 19:30.961
Seeing as it was
your birthday yesterday, I--

19:31.044 --> 19:33.130
It's fine. Birthdays aren't a big deal.

19:33.213 --> 19:35.424
- I'm just gonna--
- But I really wanna treat you.

19:38.302 --> 19:40.846
Or at least we could have some coffee.

19:40.929 --> 19:43.015
[light music]

19:46.018 --> 19:50.063
Sure, no problem. I'll make sure
you won't wanna buy me anything next year.

19:50.147 --> 19:51.899
- [Ji-ung] Good luck later.
- Okay.

19:53.650 --> 19:55.319
[breathes heavily]

19:57.696 --> 19:59.114
[chuckles, gasps]

19:59.948 --> 20:01.033
What is it?

20:01.575 --> 20:02.993
How long have you been standing there?

20:04.786 --> 20:07.497
Don't you remember?
You told me to wait for you over there.

20:08.790 --> 20:11.877
Oh, right. Did you get everything?

20:11.960 --> 20:13.045
[Chae-ran] Let's go.

20:13.128 --> 20:14.713
It's this way.

20:14.796 --> 20:15.964
Yeah, I knew that.

20:17.758 --> 20:20.010
[bright music]

20:22.846 --> 20:23.847
[music stops]

20:31.480 --> 20:32.731
[door closes]

20:38.153 --> 20:39.738
[sighs]

20:42.407 --> 20:44.326
[camera clicking]

20:49.039 --> 20:50.165
[interviewer] Mr. Choi.

20:51.708 --> 20:52.960
Mr. Choi?

20:54.378 --> 20:55.337
Oh, yeah.

20:55.420 --> 20:58.548
Are you alright?
Was my question too difficult to answer?

20:58.632 --> 21:00.300
Oh, no. It's not that.

21:00.926 --> 21:03.553
I'm sorry, but could you repeat
your question one more time?

21:04.221 --> 21:06.974
You've said you don't like to include
people in your drawings.

21:07.057 --> 21:09.142
When I look at
the work you've done, it feels like

21:09.226 --> 21:11.270
you've purposely left people out of them.

21:11.353 --> 21:13.939
It seems to me like
you've intentionally left empty spots

21:14.022 --> 21:15.232
where they're supposed to be.

21:15.315 --> 21:18.860
That's probably why we can feel loneliness
and emptiness in your drawings.

21:18.944 --> 21:21.947
I think that comes
from your decision to exclude people.

21:22.030 --> 21:23.198
Was that act intentional,

21:23.282 --> 21:26.910
or does it have something to do
with your underlying emotions?

21:32.124 --> 21:36.670
I think it depends on the viewer.
Everyone can interpret them differently.

21:36.753 --> 21:39.423
Honestly, I really haven't given it
that much thought.

21:39.506 --> 21:42.592
I understand. But sometimes,
understanding the artist's attitude

21:42.676 --> 21:44.511
helps us to understand
their pieces better.

21:45.679 --> 21:46.805
I guess…

21:47.472 --> 21:49.683
I don't have the backstory that you want.

21:50.475 --> 21:51.810
Excuse me, ma'am.

21:52.436 --> 21:55.647
Why don't you ask about
the future exhibits he's planning to have?

21:55.731 --> 21:57.024
[Eun-ho] He's got a lot of those.

21:57.107 --> 21:58.358
[chuckles softly]

22:00.986 --> 22:05.157
It always feels as if it's impossible
to have an in-depth interview with you.

22:08.452 --> 22:09.619
Ma'am, it's not like that…

22:10.412 --> 22:11.663
[sighs deeply]

22:15.083 --> 22:16.084
Go pack up.

22:19.463 --> 22:22.382
I must say, you did look
quite different doing that interview.

22:25.302 --> 22:27.929
Show this side of me more.
Please show this in the documentary.

22:28.013 --> 22:29.139
[chuckles]

22:29.222 --> 22:31.224
This reminds me, I saw the article.

22:31.308 --> 22:33.935
Do you think the footage we filmed of NJ
is going to be an issue

22:34.019 --> 22:35.604
because of the story that's going around?

22:35.687 --> 22:37.814
Well, I don't have any problems with it,

22:37.898 --> 22:40.108
but you'll have to check with NJ's agency.

22:40.192 --> 22:41.651
[sighs]

22:42.611 --> 22:46.031
Wait a minute. How come you're not asking
if the scandal is true or not?

22:46.114 --> 22:47.949
Do you think
the whole relationship's fake?

22:49.367 --> 22:50.243
Wow.

22:50.994 --> 22:54.456
It's incredible. Is Ji-ung sending out
clones of him or what?

22:54.539 --> 22:56.666
You're just like him.
This is making me feel weird.

22:57.250 --> 22:58.543
I'm sure you're acting like this,

22:58.627 --> 23:01.296
because you don't have room
to think about other people right now.

23:01.379 --> 23:03.298
You obviously have your hands full
with Yeon-su.

23:03.882 --> 23:07.052
Hey. Who said you could talk about
a private life so casually like that?

23:07.135 --> 23:09.513
Be thankful I turned off the camera first.

23:09.596 --> 23:11.890
If I had been Ji-ung,
I would have kept the camera rolling.

23:11.973 --> 23:13.934
Is it really turned off?
I should check it myself.

23:14.017 --> 23:16.311
You saw it, right? In the editing room?

23:18.730 --> 23:22.025
I'm taking about
the footage edited by Ji-ung.

23:25.028 --> 23:27.739
Well, I didn't know how to play it.

23:29.032 --> 23:31.451
[clears throat]
We're done for today, right?

23:32.452 --> 23:33.411
[clears throat]

23:38.166 --> 23:39.167
I'm lonely.

23:40.001 --> 23:41.169
So very lonely.

23:42.295 --> 23:45.924
It's true, the position of CEO
can make one feel incredibly lonely.

23:46.967 --> 23:48.468
But as a true leader,

23:48.552 --> 23:52.597
I guess I should accept my fate
and take complete responsibility

23:52.681 --> 23:54.724
in order to fully develop this company.

23:55.475 --> 23:57.227
You noticed it just now, right?

23:57.894 --> 24:00.105
[sighs]
Everyone was having coffee without me

24:00.689 --> 24:03.692
and excluding me in their conversations.
[sad chuckle]

24:04.985 --> 24:05.986
Don't you agree?

24:07.529 --> 24:09.322
Ms. Kook, are you listening to me?

24:10.323 --> 24:11.575
[Yi-hoon] Hello?

24:12.200 --> 24:15.245
Honestly, in the first place,
I haven't done anything wrong, have I?

24:15.328 --> 24:18.081
Can you explain it to me?
Am I really such a bad person?

24:18.165 --> 24:19.207
You can be honest.

24:19.291 --> 24:21.459
You don't have to
filter anything, seriously.

24:23.336 --> 24:24.796
- Sir.
- Hmm?

24:24.880 --> 24:27.841
You know something, you're just
a little more clueless than others.

24:27.924 --> 24:29.801
You're not a bad person.
You were like that in college too.

24:30.385 --> 24:31.845
Just don't take it too personally.

24:33.054 --> 24:34.848
[stutters]

24:34.931 --> 24:36.600
[scoffs]
Who? Me?

24:38.101 --> 24:40.562
[chuckles]
Excuse me, I'm pretty smart.

24:40.645 --> 24:44.191
In fact, I know perfectly well what
the others were talking about a while ago.

24:44.274 --> 24:47.319
And I could've smoothly joined in
on the conversation if I really wanted to.

24:47.402 --> 24:50.906
They were busy gossiping
about Go-oh and NJ the whole day.

24:51.406 --> 24:53.992
[Yeon-su] What do you think are
the chances of your ex getting involved

24:54.075 --> 24:55.994
in a scandal with a celebrity?

24:56.077 --> 24:58.038
Thing is,
they all want to know if it's true

24:58.121 --> 24:59.748
that those two are really dating or not.

24:59.831 --> 25:01.625
But they don't know anything.
[chuckles]

25:02.375 --> 25:03.501
You wanna know what I think?

25:04.461 --> 25:05.754
Of course they're dating.

25:05.837 --> 25:08.924
[Yeon-su] Whatever the chances are,
one thing's for sure,

25:09.007 --> 25:11.968
- it feels very, very…
- When Go-oh saw NJ that day I could see

25:12.052 --> 25:13.178
he seemed totally mesmerized.

25:13.762 --> 25:15.722
- [Yeon-su] It feels very crappy.
- You see that?

25:15.805 --> 25:17.307
Told you I'm sharp. See, huh?

25:17.390 --> 25:18.558
[chuckles]

25:18.642 --> 25:20.477
All right, you are smart.

25:20.560 --> 25:22.938
So why don't you take a hint
and leave me alone?

25:23.021 --> 25:24.606
As you can see, I'm working right now.

25:25.190 --> 25:27.025
Hmm. I'm leaving.

25:27.776 --> 25:28.777
Take it easy.

25:29.819 --> 25:30.862
[chuckles]

25:31.363 --> 25:32.530
Told you I'm not clueless.

25:33.156 --> 25:36.952
[Yeon-su] I have to hear about it,
like it's everywhere I go all day long.

25:37.911 --> 25:39.454
Throughout the entire day…

25:44.417 --> 25:46.253
it follows me everywhere.

25:46.336 --> 25:48.421
[cheeky music]

25:49.798 --> 25:51.883
[girl 1] NJ must really
be dating him this time.

25:51.967 --> 25:53.843
[girl 2] I know, right?
Did you see the photo?

25:53.927 --> 25:55.720
- [girl 2] He's kinda cute.
- [girl 1] What?

25:55.804 --> 25:57.639
He's super cute in his old photos too.

25:58.223 --> 26:00.433
[girl 2] Now I know the reason
why NJ fell for him.

26:00.517 --> 26:03.561
[Yeon-su] I really don't want
to hear or know more about them. 

26:03.645 --> 26:05.689
[cheeky music continues]

26:09.901 --> 26:11.569
[sighs]
Right.

26:11.653 --> 26:13.905
Just keep walking. Keep walking.

26:16.825 --> 26:18.285
[cheery tune]

26:18.368 --> 26:19.661
[inhales]

26:23.540 --> 26:25.875
Excuse me, how much are these jujubes for?

26:25.959 --> 26:27.919
Oh, 5,000 won per basket.

26:28.003 --> 26:29.129
Oh. I'll get one, please.

26:29.212 --> 26:30.422
Yes, all right.

26:31.965 --> 26:34.217
Goodness. Don't you have any change?

26:34.301 --> 26:37.095
Oh. It's okay, I'll get all of them, then.

26:37.178 --> 26:40.140
Oh really? Thank you very much, dear.

26:40.223 --> 26:42.559
Are you sure? This is quite a lot.

26:43.226 --> 26:45.812
But what would a young lady
be doing with so many jujubes?

26:45.895 --> 26:48.523
Jujube tea is good is you have insomnia.

26:48.606 --> 26:49.441
What?

26:50.275 --> 26:51.776
[soft chuckle]
I heard it somewhere.

26:52.527 --> 26:55.071
Is that so? Here you go.

26:55.739 --> 26:58.491
Oh, wait.
Let me put it in another bag for you.

26:58.575 --> 27:00.035
- [Yeon-su] Yeah, thanks.
- Here you go.

27:02.037 --> 27:03.663
- Have a good day.
- [woman] Bye.

27:03.747 --> 27:06.166
[both chuckle]

27:15.633 --> 27:17.552
Why did I bother buying these?

27:20.221 --> 27:21.222
[sighs]

27:22.307 --> 27:24.351
Ji-ung, we can go to a fancier place.

27:24.434 --> 27:26.519
I was going to buy you
something delicious.

27:27.354 --> 27:29.898
I have a hardy appetite.
You'll be surprised.

27:31.983 --> 27:33.151
[Dong-il] Ji-ung!

27:33.234 --> 27:35.070
Hold on, Chae-ran's here too!

27:35.153 --> 27:39.407
Wow, you're eating here?
Oh, my, what a huge coincidence!

27:39.491 --> 27:41.368
Hmm, isn't this great?

27:41.451 --> 27:43.995
We've gathered in the same place, right?

27:46.915 --> 27:49.042
Come sit with us. Sit down.

27:49.542 --> 27:51.586
[quirky music]

27:59.094 --> 28:02.180
[sighs]
Why did I even bother going here?

28:10.313 --> 28:11.439
[sighs]

28:19.906 --> 28:22.826
- Oh!
- Yes, I'll e-mail you… Oh, Yeon-su.

28:23.368 --> 28:25.829
I'm sorry. Let me check first
and I'll call you right away.

28:26.913 --> 28:27.914
Did you come here to see Ung?

28:27.997 --> 28:31.418
Yes, there's something I have to tell him.
He's just inside, right?

28:31.501 --> 28:32.627
He's not home now.

28:32.710 --> 28:35.004
I think he's still at the restaurant.
Should I call him?

28:35.088 --> 28:37.048
No, don't, it's fine. It's nothing urgent.

28:37.132 --> 28:39.175
- I can talk to him later.
- You came all the way here.

28:39.259 --> 28:40.677
- Go wait inside. Come on.
- No, it's okay.

28:40.760 --> 28:42.220
- You brought a lot of stuff too.
- It's really…

28:42.303 --> 28:43.930
It's okay, come inside.
He'll be back soon.

28:44.931 --> 28:45.932
Just go in.

28:46.599 --> 28:48.476
When you see Ung,
tell him I left already, okay.

28:51.354 --> 28:52.188
[thuds]

29:01.364 --> 29:03.825
[gentle music]

29:06.202 --> 29:08.246
[clattering]

29:16.087 --> 29:17.005
[sighs]

29:18.631 --> 29:19.591
[groans]

29:21.551 --> 29:23.553
[gentle music continues]

29:27.307 --> 29:28.308
[sighs]

29:29.976 --> 29:31.686
Listen, guys, I can't believe
we're only doing this now.

29:31.770 --> 29:33.605
We should have had a gathering sooner.

29:33.688 --> 29:36.399
Plus it was Mr. Kim's birthday yesterday.

29:36.483 --> 29:39.694
[Dong-il] Don't you think
it's nice to drink together like this?

29:39.778 --> 29:41.488
Your work's all going well, right?

29:41.571 --> 29:44.032
[Min-gyeong] Hey, PD Kim,
was it your birthday?

29:44.657 --> 29:47.118
I had no idea. Let me pour you a glass.

29:47.202 --> 29:49.454
It's fine, I already drank enough.

29:49.537 --> 29:51.122
Anyway, I'm not a heavy drinker like you.

29:51.206 --> 29:52.499
Oh, my goodness.

29:53.166 --> 29:55.877
How could you have lasted this long
in the field and not drink?

29:55.960 --> 29:58.046
It's not like we can drink
while we're working.

29:58.129 --> 29:59.756
[huffs]
Oh.

29:59.839 --> 30:02.425
I don't know why, but I really
can't appreciate people who don't drink.

30:02.509 --> 30:04.219
I find them so boring.

30:04.302 --> 30:05.929
At least I do my job well.

30:06.012 --> 30:07.764
Even your videos were boring.

30:08.431 --> 30:10.600
[tense music]

30:11.935 --> 30:15.855
His work was better back in the day
when he listened to my advice.

30:15.939 --> 30:18.399
But now he just goes
and does anything he wants.

30:18.483 --> 30:19.776
Anything he wants, huh!

30:19.859 --> 30:22.695
You're only saying those things
because I never did what you wanted.

30:22.779 --> 30:24.906
You sure about that? Tell me something,

30:25.573 --> 30:27.367
do you really like what you've shot?

30:28.284 --> 30:29.994
[Min-gyeong] You don't, right?

30:30.078 --> 30:33.790
No way. Have you lost your touch,
or what? Really?

30:35.083 --> 30:36.709
No way.

30:36.793 --> 30:38.670
We were all in a good drinking mood.

30:39.254 --> 30:40.839
[Dong-il] Why are you
making him uncomfortable?

30:42.090 --> 30:44.300
Come on, Intern. Let's go.

30:44.384 --> 30:45.969
Oh, that's right, you quit.

30:46.052 --> 30:48.012
Finish your talk
before the food gets here.

30:48.763 --> 30:50.932
And will you two stop fighting for once?

30:51.015 --> 30:52.267
We're not fighting at all.

30:52.350 --> 30:54.435
This is how I show PD Kim
how much I like him.

30:54.519 --> 30:56.020
[Dong-il] Unfortunately, he hates you.

30:56.104 --> 30:58.565
Couldn't you be nicer?
Why are you always so harsh?

31:00.275 --> 31:01.985
Man, I don't get her.

31:02.735 --> 31:06.030
Oh, did he have to overreact like that?
He's making me feel embarrassed.

31:06.114 --> 31:07.407
[drink pours]

31:09.033 --> 31:10.285
[sniffs]

31:10.368 --> 31:11.744
Did I upset you?

31:13.538 --> 31:14.539
Sorry.

31:15.582 --> 31:17.750
It's just that sometimes
when I'm telling the truth,

31:17.834 --> 31:20.420
I can't control
what's coming out of my mouth.

31:20.503 --> 31:23.172
What a way to emphasize
that you were telling the truth.

31:24.465 --> 31:25.717
[chuckles]

31:26.342 --> 31:28.219
[Min-gyeong] Come on,
you know it's the truth.

31:31.097 --> 31:32.140
Why? What is it?

31:32.849 --> 31:34.350
What's your problem anyway?

31:34.934 --> 31:38.521
I saw your draft, but I still don't get
what you wanna say, hm?

31:41.733 --> 31:42.901
[sighs]

31:42.984 --> 31:44.402
You like Yeon-su, don't you?

31:45.820 --> 31:47.864
[soft vulnerable music]

31:52.911 --> 31:54.370
What? No way.

31:55.330 --> 31:58.499
Am I right about that?
Was it because of that?

31:58.583 --> 32:01.669
Oh, this is finally getting interesting.
[chuckles]

32:02.378 --> 32:04.756
Did you really have to blurt that out
in front of our co-worker?

32:05.673 --> 32:08.134
- You knew too, right?
- Forget it.

32:09.344 --> 32:12.013
Why are you guys all so quick to catch on?
It's embarrassing.

32:12.096 --> 32:13.723
[chuckles]

32:13.806 --> 32:15.475
[Min-gyeong] That's the thing
about cameras.

32:16.142 --> 32:17.727
They pretend to be objective,

32:17.810 --> 32:20.605
but actually have
the most personal perspective.

32:20.688 --> 32:22.523
Ji-ung, the reason why I like you

32:22.607 --> 32:25.193
it's because you also pretend
to be an objective observer.

32:25.276 --> 32:28.279
But your pieces
portray your emotions very well.

32:28.863 --> 32:30.698
- You just called them boring.
- So I'm saying…

32:31.699 --> 32:35.536
you should go, watch your videos,
then edit them again.

32:36.788 --> 32:38.873
I get that you're trying
to show multiple perspectives

32:38.957 --> 32:41.042
because you are emotionally confused,

32:41.709 --> 32:43.127
but set that aside.

32:43.753 --> 32:46.464
Why don't you look at the cast
and follow their gaze?

32:50.969 --> 32:52.053
[Min-gyeong] Okay?

32:55.515 --> 32:57.183
[deep sigh]

33:07.235 --> 33:08.152
[inhales]

33:13.241 --> 33:14.492
COTAULD GALLERY

33:16.160 --> 33:17.829
ARTIST GO-OH

33:20.289 --> 33:21.833
MUSEUM OF AVANT-GARDE
PARIS, FRANCE

33:24.460 --> 33:26.629
CONCERNING VARIABILITY AND INVARIABILITY

33:28.715 --> 33:29.757
[doorbell ringing]

33:32.260 --> 33:33.678
[sighs]

33:34.929 --> 33:35.847
[exhales]

33:40.059 --> 33:40.935
Oh.

33:41.644 --> 33:42.520
[chuckles]

33:45.815 --> 33:48.026
Hi, good evening. Nice seeing you again.

33:48.860 --> 33:50.445
Oh. Right.

33:57.785 --> 33:59.037
The hell?

34:00.079 --> 34:01.247
Huh?

34:10.840 --> 34:12.800
[soft music]

34:12.884 --> 34:13.718
[scoffs]

34:20.767 --> 34:22.977
[soft music continues]

34:32.862 --> 34:33.780
[groans]

34:44.123 --> 34:46.125
[soft music]

34:46.918 --> 34:47.919
HAPPY DAYS

34:50.088 --> 34:52.381
[NJ] Congratulations on your scandal
with a superstar.

34:52.465 --> 34:54.300
Don't drink the whole bottle by yourself.

34:54.884 --> 34:55.927
Half of it's mine.

34:56.010 --> 34:58.513
P.S. Try not to stay out too late.

35:04.894 --> 35:07.522
[gentle relaxed music]

35:19.450 --> 35:20.326
[gasps]

35:29.127 --> 35:31.420
[gentle relaxed music continues]

35:52.441 --> 35:54.694
[NJ] There's something
I've been meaning to ask you.

35:57.822 --> 36:01.325
Listen, I'm not getting
between the two of you, am I?

36:01.409 --> 36:03.911
- [NJ] Because I wouldn't want that.
- Not at all.

36:05.371 --> 36:08.457
I mean, there's nothing
going on between us right now.

36:08.541 --> 36:11.377
Oh. You said, "Right now".

36:12.295 --> 36:13.713
[chuckles]

36:15.173 --> 36:16.424
Are the two of you…

36:20.887 --> 36:22.096
Never mind.

36:23.055 --> 36:26.184
I'm guessing you read the article
that came out about us.

36:26.267 --> 36:27.977
But yes, Ung and I are dating.

36:29.979 --> 36:31.147
[chuckles softly]

36:33.649 --> 36:36.277
At least, that's what
I was thinking of saying,

36:36.360 --> 36:38.821
but hearing it out loud,
it sounds too corny.

36:39.572 --> 36:42.575
There's no point
talking about this by ourselves.

36:42.658 --> 36:44.785
Mr. Choi would be so proud
if he sees us like this.

36:44.869 --> 36:46.329
He'll brag about it forever.

36:47.163 --> 36:50.333
[groans]
I have no plans of seeing him do that,

36:50.416 --> 36:52.001
so let's not fight about this.

36:53.669 --> 36:56.172
If I'm not in the way,
then this should be fine.

36:56.255 --> 36:57.757
[NJ] I'll pursue this on my own.

36:59.967 --> 37:02.053
[soft charged music]

37:11.646 --> 37:12.730
[Yeon-su] But then…

37:14.190 --> 37:16.317
something tells me you won't

37:16.400 --> 37:18.277
stop even if I tell you to.

37:21.572 --> 37:22.531
[chuckles softly]

37:25.451 --> 37:26.702
No, I won't.

37:30.164 --> 37:31.207
[sighs]

37:32.291 --> 37:34.502
[music fades]

37:40.591 --> 37:41.801
[pencil scraping]

37:44.220 --> 37:45.805
[sighs]

37:46.389 --> 37:47.556
[sighs deeply]

37:48.891 --> 37:50.393
What am I even doing?

37:52.895 --> 37:54.021
[puffs]

37:58.526 --> 37:59.443
[sucks teeth]

38:03.072 --> 38:04.240
[sighs]

38:05.825 --> 38:07.118
[doorbell ringing]

38:09.537 --> 38:10.788
[doorbell ringing again]

38:20.298 --> 38:21.590
[sighs]

38:21.674 --> 38:22.717
Hey.

38:24.093 --> 38:25.344
Have you been drinking again?

38:25.428 --> 38:26.679
[water pours]

38:29.974 --> 38:32.935
Wow, I guess
drinking agrees with you nowadays.

38:33.019 --> 38:34.312
[Ung] This isn't like you.

38:34.395 --> 38:35.604
[sighs]

38:39.108 --> 38:42.236
You should've gone home if you're drunk.
Why did you bother coming here?

38:43.612 --> 38:44.739
[sighs]

38:44.822 --> 38:46.741
Thanks for bringing me food last time.

38:46.824 --> 38:49.118
What? You shouldn't thank me,
you should be thanking my mom.

38:49.201 --> 38:51.996
She told me to give it to you.
You came here just to say that?

38:52.872 --> 38:54.290
I heard you came by the office.

38:55.082 --> 38:56.667
Yeah, well…

38:56.751 --> 38:58.669
How come you always tell others
you're busy working

38:58.753 --> 39:00.171
when you weren't even at your desk?

39:01.922 --> 39:03.132
[sighs]

39:03.215 --> 39:04.592
[groans]

39:05.676 --> 39:07.094
Just try to get some sleep.

39:07.970 --> 39:09.513
I'm going to work a bit more.

39:10.806 --> 39:12.099
Somebody told me…

39:14.477 --> 39:17.063
that the shots taken with my camera
are full of emotions.

39:20.399 --> 39:22.318
And that even if I try to hide it,

39:22.401 --> 39:24.570
it's no use, because it's so obvious.

39:27.156 --> 39:28.366
Do you think so too?

39:29.867 --> 39:30.993
[scoffs]

39:31.077 --> 39:32.912
No, I don't get what you're saying.

39:33.829 --> 39:34.705
[groans]

39:39.627 --> 39:41.253
You saw everything, right?

39:43.672 --> 39:45.299
[soft vulnerable music]

39:45.383 --> 39:46.300
Didn't you?

39:53.974 --> 39:55.267
Well…

39:59.522 --> 40:00.815
I'm really not sure.

40:00.898 --> 40:02.400
Wait.
[chuckles sadly]

40:03.818 --> 40:06.070
You mean you don't want me to mention it.

40:06.153 --> 40:07.154
Am I right?

40:08.864 --> 40:10.783
You're just drunk. Sleep it off.

40:11.283 --> 40:12.785
[chuckles]

40:14.328 --> 40:15.788
You're telling me to keep quiet

40:16.831 --> 40:18.332
because you don't want to know.

40:19.375 --> 40:20.251
Right?

40:24.296 --> 40:26.382
[soft vulnerable music]

40:28.509 --> 40:29.677
[sad scoff]

40:33.973 --> 40:35.641
I knew this would happen,

40:38.477 --> 40:40.396
that makes me so upset.

40:45.901 --> 40:46.735
[scoffs]

40:51.532 --> 40:53.617
[soft vulnerable music continues]

41:00.916 --> 41:02.334
[chuckles]

41:02.418 --> 41:05.004
It's not like
our last day of filming is special.

41:06.755 --> 41:08.090
[inhales]

41:15.222 --> 41:17.308
Wait, isn't today the day…

41:18.392 --> 41:21.770
SEAFOOD SOUP WITH UNG

41:21.854 --> 41:23.856
[Eun-ho] Did you just wake up
or you haven't slept yet?

41:23.939 --> 41:27.401
Anyway, I wanted to remind you
that today's the last day of filming.

41:27.485 --> 41:29.778
So get ready.
I'll head over soon. You got it?

41:29.862 --> 41:30.863
Okay.

41:35.534 --> 41:37.328
CLOSED TODAY

41:41.874 --> 41:43.792
[Eun-ho] Why isn't he answering his phone?

41:46.420 --> 41:47.379
[Eun-ho sighs]

41:48.339 --> 41:51.217
Ji-ung, why is Mr. Choi acting like this?

41:51.300 --> 41:53.677
Does he think he can get away with it
because you two are friends?

41:53.761 --> 41:56.472
He's gone AWOL on the last day of filming.

41:56.555 --> 41:59.850
Why did he even agree to do this
if he was going to treat this as a joke?

41:59.934 --> 42:02.061
I'm sorry. Sorry. I apologize.

42:02.144 --> 42:04.188
I even called him this morning
to remind him of the shoot.

42:04.271 --> 42:06.774
You know what?
This isn't the first time he's done this.

42:06.857 --> 42:08.150
You should've made sure he was here.

42:08.234 --> 42:10.694
He's not taking us seriously.
In fact, why is he so disrespectful?

42:11.695 --> 42:13.364
Sorry. I'm really sorry.

42:13.447 --> 42:15.616
I'll go check out
all the places he could've gone to

42:15.699 --> 42:17.117
- and bring him back right away.
- Forget it.

42:17.993 --> 42:22.706
Ji-ung. You're always covering for him.
That's why he's being so selfish.

42:22.790 --> 42:24.291
[sighs]

42:24.833 --> 42:27.044
Let me apologize instead. I'm sorry.

42:27.127 --> 42:29.171
- Let's just call it a day and--
- Excuse me, Ms. Kook.

42:29.255 --> 42:30.422
Don't you know what's going on?

42:30.506 --> 42:32.424
Did something happen
and you don't wanna tell us?

42:32.508 --> 42:34.301
- Stop, Chae-ran!
- I'm sorry about

42:34.385 --> 42:36.637
how we disappeared the last time.

42:36.720 --> 42:40.015
But I'm telling you nothing happened
between us. I haven't seen him in a while.

42:45.771 --> 42:47.648
[Yeon-su] Wait, isn't today the day…

42:48.732 --> 42:50.067
[inhales]

42:52.236 --> 42:53.862
I'll try to bring him back.

42:53.946 --> 42:55.990
- Do you know what's going on with him?
- I don't.

42:56.073 --> 42:57.408
But I'm going to go look for him.

42:59.743 --> 43:00.869
Me too. I'll look for him too.

43:05.207 --> 43:08.294
Ji-ung, don't you think
you're being too easy on Mr. Choi?

43:09.086 --> 43:11.255
Even if he's your friend,
this is going too far.

43:12.798 --> 43:13.632
The thing is…

43:15.759 --> 43:17.803
I kind of feel like
maybe I chased him away.

43:18.387 --> 43:19.263
What?

43:26.145 --> 43:27.187
[music stops]

43:36.864 --> 43:39.116
Oh. Hey, Ung! How are you?

43:39.199 --> 43:40.743
Hi. Nice to see you.

43:40.826 --> 43:42.411
[chuckles]
It's been such a long time.

43:42.494 --> 43:44.872
I haven't seen you since you graduated.

43:44.955 --> 43:48.500
I'm glad you're here to visit me.
You should come by more often.

43:49.752 --> 43:51.378
Well…

43:51.462 --> 43:53.005
How come I don't see Jjongjjong?

43:53.088 --> 43:54.632
Oh, Jjongjjong?

43:54.715 --> 43:56.300
Uh, he's gone far away.

43:58.886 --> 44:02.640
Oh, my, is that so?
I'm so sorry, I was just…

44:02.723 --> 44:05.225
What? Oh, there he is.
[shop owner chuckles]

44:06.101 --> 44:09.897
Looks like somebody had a blast
during their walk today, hmm?

44:09.980 --> 44:12.149
Oh, you definitely
need a bath today, Jjongjjong.

44:13.776 --> 44:14.943
- Thank you, girls.
- No problem.

44:15.027 --> 44:17.613
And I can take care
of all of Jjongjjong's walks.

44:18.238 --> 44:20.115
[girl] He's the cutest dog ever.

44:20.199 --> 44:21.450
- Goodbye and thank you.
- Oh, bye.

44:23.744 --> 44:27.373
Wait a minute. Didn't Jjongjjong hate
going outside because he was traumatized?

44:27.456 --> 44:29.708
Oh, that was such a long time ago.

44:30.209 --> 44:32.378
As a matter of fact,
he hates staying indoors now.

44:32.461 --> 44:33.587
[chuckles]

44:33.671 --> 44:36.173
I see. When did he change?

44:36.256 --> 44:37.925
And how did you do it?

44:38.008 --> 44:40.386
[chuckles]
Oh, no, not me. I didn't do anything.

44:41.804 --> 44:43.430
[shop owner] He did it all by himself.

44:44.223 --> 44:45.557
Didn't you, Jjongjjong?

44:46.558 --> 44:48.602
- [shop owner chuckles]
- [soft music]

44:52.564 --> 44:53.649
You traitor.

44:54.733 --> 44:55.901
[sighs]

44:57.027 --> 44:59.863
[soft music continues]

45:05.494 --> 45:06.787
[sighs]

45:06.870 --> 45:07.996
So cold.

45:11.917 --> 45:12.793
EDITING ROOM

45:16.171 --> 45:17.005
[door closes]

45:18.590 --> 45:20.175
[sighs deeply]

45:20.259 --> 45:22.678
[Min-gyeong] I get you're trying
to show multiple perspectives

45:22.761 --> 45:25.013
because you are emotionally confused,

45:25.097 --> 45:26.515
but set that aside.

45:27.141 --> 45:29.476
Why don't you look at the cast
and follow their gaze?

45:30.602 --> 45:32.604
[gentle music]

45:37.901 --> 45:38.819
[squeaks]

45:44.283 --> 45:47.077
[mouse clicking]

45:49.121 --> 45:50.330
- [phone buzzing]
- [sighs]

45:53.917 --> 45:56.712
Hey. I haven't found him. What about you?

45:56.795 --> 45:58.755
No. And I couldn't reach
his parents either,

45:58.839 --> 46:01.758
so I had to ask the hardware store owner.
He said they went to the countryside.

46:02.468 --> 46:04.636
[Eun-ho sighs]
He's not at the bookstore or the library.

46:04.720 --> 46:06.013
I can't find him anywhere.

46:06.096 --> 46:07.514
Like he really doesn't wanna be found.

46:07.598 --> 46:09.641
He's not going to be
at his usual spots then.

46:09.725 --> 46:11.143
Let's try unexpected places.

46:11.852 --> 46:13.687
Call me as soon as you find Ung.

46:16.982 --> 46:17.900
[sighs]

46:19.818 --> 46:21.445
Oh! What the heck!

46:22.029 --> 46:25.657
You jerk! You… you scumbag!
You're such an idiot!

46:25.741 --> 46:26.909
[relieved sigh]

46:27.576 --> 46:28.994
I almost had a heartattack.

46:33.665 --> 46:35.209
Please, let me carry that for you.

46:35.292 --> 46:37.669
No need, it's fine. Don't sweat it.

46:37.753 --> 46:39.588
Oh, but your bag looks really heavy.

46:39.671 --> 46:42.007
I really don't mind carrying it for you
until you're home.

46:42.090 --> 46:43.342
I told you, it's okay.

46:43.425 --> 46:45.636
- Then at least until the bus station…
- I said, it's fine!

46:45.719 --> 46:47.971
I don't need your help.
Why are you doing this? No.

46:48.055 --> 46:49.389
[groans]

46:51.183 --> 46:52.142
Oh, no…

46:56.313 --> 46:58.440
[soft music]

47:06.907 --> 47:09.076
[soft music continues]

47:13.914 --> 47:15.249
You can leave it there.

47:18.585 --> 47:21.797
Right. It looks like
you're drying a lot of jujubes.

47:23.840 --> 47:24.841
[sighs]

47:25.801 --> 47:27.052
Don't know what they're for.

47:27.135 --> 47:28.220
For some reason,

47:28.303 --> 47:30.847
Yeon-su bought a whole lot of them
recently and put them there.

47:31.431 --> 47:33.267
The foolish girl keeps making jujube tea.

47:33.350 --> 47:35.561
And she never tells me
who she's making it for.

47:40.482 --> 47:42.734
This is jujube tea.
You have a hard time sleeping…

47:43.610 --> 47:46.530
I mean, you're working,
so my boss told me to give this to you.

47:48.365 --> 47:50.784
[gentle music]

47:55.247 --> 47:57.457
[whispering]
I can't believe I'm gonna say this.

47:58.208 --> 47:59.167
[inhales]

48:00.919 --> 48:05.674
If ever Yeon-su
has treated you badly or hurt you,

48:05.757 --> 48:07.843
I want you to know it's all my fault.

48:08.635 --> 48:10.554
That's why don't hate her too much.

48:11.388 --> 48:12.973
My family is poor,

48:13.932 --> 48:16.935
so while growing up,
I taught her to be selfish.

48:19.563 --> 48:22.649
I'm to blame.
It's my fault why she acts like that.

48:23.525 --> 48:25.193
Why she's so harsh.

48:25.277 --> 48:28.655
And it's also my fault
that she has a bad temper.

48:28.739 --> 48:29.906
That's why,

48:31.283 --> 48:33.910
if you're upset at her about something,

48:33.994 --> 48:36.163
you should blame me and no one else.

48:38.373 --> 48:40.125
Don't hate her for being that way.

48:46.214 --> 48:47.966
I know Yeon-su's not like that.

48:51.470 --> 48:53.597
She's neither selfish, nor mean.

48:54.514 --> 48:55.599
She's a…

48:57.643 --> 48:58.644
good person.

49:01.647 --> 49:03.940
She's so brilliant
it's like I don't deserve her.

49:04.024 --> 49:05.150
[deep inhale]

49:05.901 --> 49:08.904
So, if you've known that all along,

49:09.780 --> 49:11.573
then what are you two doing?

49:14.117 --> 49:15.202
You're right, ma'am.

49:17.162 --> 49:18.705
I knew I was being pathetic,

49:21.124 --> 49:23.710
but I guess this is the day
I've finally hit rock bottom.

49:26.755 --> 49:29.216
[gentle pensive music]

49:32.052 --> 49:32.969
[sighs]

49:34.721 --> 49:35.639
[exhales]

49:39.226 --> 49:40.602
[deep sigh]

49:41.186 --> 49:42.396
Choi Ung.

49:45.023 --> 49:47.609
Stop hiding and come out already.

49:52.406 --> 49:53.865
[sighs deeply]

49:58.787 --> 50:00.956
[Chae-ran] Ji-ung,
do you want me to order dinner?

50:04.376 --> 50:05.335
Ji-ung…

50:18.056 --> 50:23.061
EDITING ROOM

50:29.025 --> 50:32.904
Uh, well, I think it's better
to do something you're good at

50:32.988 --> 50:35.824
rather than ending up
doing only something that you like.

50:35.907 --> 50:37.284
That way, you'll be more efficient,

50:37.367 --> 50:39.161
and you still gain from it
in the long run.

50:46.835 --> 50:48.879
[soft sweet music]

50:51.173 --> 50:52.340
[soft chuckle]

50:54.926 --> 50:56.178
[inhales]

50:57.596 --> 50:59.598
[sighing]

51:01.308 --> 51:03.727
[soft sweet music continues]

51:14.488 --> 51:16.573
[gentle music]

51:30.420 --> 51:32.672
It was much harder
to find you this time, Choi Ung.

51:36.760 --> 51:37.803
[sighs]

51:40.555 --> 51:41.765
How did you find me?

51:41.848 --> 51:44.684
What do you think I did?
I just looked everywhere for you.

51:52.317 --> 51:54.653
I remember you doing this before.

51:54.736 --> 51:57.197
You used to disappear
around this time of year.

51:57.280 --> 51:59.950
[Yeon-su] And strangely enough,
your parents would disappear too.

52:01.701 --> 52:04.287
I had forgotten about it,
it came back to me today.

52:06.373 --> 52:09.459
The good thing is,
I've been wanting to do this for a while.

52:11.545 --> 52:15.006
To sit down with you
and have some drinks again.

52:19.719 --> 52:21.513
[deep sigh]

52:29.521 --> 52:30.689
[cup thuds]

52:37.445 --> 52:38.655
[cup thuds]

52:52.836 --> 52:54.421
Are you done avoiding me?

52:57.132 --> 52:58.675
You're not even telling me to leave.

53:01.761 --> 53:02.971
I never avoided you.

53:04.598 --> 53:06.766
So you're saying I was imagining things?

53:20.697 --> 53:21.781
[cup thuds]

53:30.248 --> 53:32.083
[deep sigh]

53:33.168 --> 53:34.920
You're not saying a word.

53:42.677 --> 53:43.720
What should I say?

53:47.891 --> 53:51.061
You can say anything,
just don't… beat around the bush,

53:51.686 --> 53:53.146
or avoid the topic

53:54.522 --> 53:55.941
or deliberately hurt me.

54:03.865 --> 54:04.991
[inhales]

54:06.451 --> 54:08.370
I guess you're choosing
to be silent again.

54:11.456 --> 54:13.041
Fine, but I'm going to talk.

54:22.133 --> 54:23.218
[cup thuds]

54:26.638 --> 54:28.098
[sighs]

54:30.266 --> 54:31.184
[sucks teeth]

54:33.520 --> 54:34.854
Ung, you know…

54:38.566 --> 54:39.734
It's about…

54:42.278 --> 54:45.782
About you asking
that we try and be friends.

54:48.660 --> 54:49.786
[inhales]

54:50.662 --> 54:52.664
I've been thinking about it a lot and…

54:56.001 --> 54:57.127
I don't think I can do it.

55:01.214 --> 55:02.173
I mean…

55:03.466 --> 55:05.552
I'm not saying I don't wanna be friends.

55:08.513 --> 55:09.764
It's just…

55:11.975 --> 55:13.977
I just… I can't…

55:16.688 --> 55:17.939
I really missed you.

55:18.982 --> 55:20.066
Kook Yeon-su.

55:26.656 --> 55:28.950
I always… missed you.

55:31.911 --> 55:34.080
["The Giving Tree"
by Lee Seung Yoon playing]

55:35.915 --> 55:37.042
And I…

55:38.668 --> 55:39.711
I missed you.

55:47.802 --> 55:49.471
When you came back into my life,

55:52.891 --> 55:55.852
I kept feeling angry for some reason
even though you were finally back.

55:58.897 --> 56:01.066
[Ung] I resented you so much.

56:04.778 --> 56:06.571
But I think I know the reason now.

56:10.283 --> 56:11.242
I guess…

56:12.952 --> 56:14.954
It was because
I wanted to see you love me.

56:21.086 --> 56:22.253
I want…

56:27.467 --> 56:29.511
I wanted to see you love only me.

56:30.512 --> 56:32.597
["The Giving Tree"
by Lee Seung Yoon continues]

56:45.860 --> 56:46.820
Yeon-su.

56:51.241 --> 56:52.242
Hmm?

56:54.661 --> 56:55.912
Yeon-su, keep loving me.

57:00.625 --> 57:01.668
Don't let me go…

57:03.920 --> 57:04.921
and keep…

57:06.798 --> 57:07.882
keep loving me.

57:16.516 --> 57:17.600
I beg you.

57:21.312 --> 57:22.439
[sniffling]

57:27.944 --> 57:30.280
["The Giving Tree" continues]

57:43.626 --> 57:50.383
OUR NIGHTS ARE MORE BEAUTIFUL
THAN YOUR DAYS

58:08.860 --> 58:11.821
EPILOGUE

58:14.324 --> 58:15.950
- Yeon-su.
- Hmm?

58:17.994 --> 58:20.455
Do you wanna know how a person
can see the top of a building?

58:21.331 --> 58:23.291
Yeah, you can go up
to a different building.

58:23.958 --> 58:25.335
Ding! Wrong answer.

58:26.920 --> 58:28.129
[groans]

58:28.963 --> 58:31.966
[chuckling]
Hey, don't tell me that you're drunk?

58:32.050 --> 58:34.469
[both chuckling]

58:35.178 --> 58:36.721
[Ung] I was told this is how to do it.

58:37.305 --> 58:39.557
Who's the fool
who came up with a story like that?

58:40.225 --> 58:41.100
It was my dad.

58:42.143 --> 58:44.479
My goodness. He is a wise man.

58:44.562 --> 58:45.522
[chuckles]

58:45.605 --> 58:47.732
[Yeon-su chuckles, inhales]

58:49.442 --> 58:51.152
- [Ung chuckling]
- [Yeon-su] My gosh.

58:53.029 --> 58:54.030
[groans]

58:54.113 --> 58:55.240
[chuckles]

58:57.116 --> 58:58.409
I still can't see it, though.

58:58.493 --> 59:01.079
I know. That's exactly what I said.

59:02.038 --> 59:03.373
How long ago was that?

59:03.456 --> 59:04.582
[inhales]

59:06.042 --> 59:08.920
When I was about five? Maybe six?

59:09.504 --> 59:11.130
[chuckles softly]

59:11.214 --> 59:13.550
I see, he was just teasing you then.

59:13.633 --> 59:15.051
[both chuckle]

59:17.804 --> 59:18.972
[Yeon-su] Hm.

59:20.431 --> 59:21.933
It wasn't my current dad.

59:25.436 --> 59:26.271
What?

59:26.980 --> 59:28.064
It was my real dad.

59:32.193 --> 59:33.528
Sure he was teasing me.

59:34.279 --> 59:36.948
He told a little kid
to lie down on the ground

59:37.615 --> 59:39.701
and count
to the top floor of the building.

59:42.036 --> 59:43.746
I didn't even know how to count well then.

59:45.164 --> 59:46.749
I counted one, two…

59:47.917 --> 59:49.794
then I'd start with one all over again.

59:51.337 --> 59:52.714
Eventually, I got up.

59:56.801 --> 59:57.844
When I did,

59:59.804 --> 01:00:02.181
I saw my dad… was gone.

01:00:06.060 --> 01:00:06.978
[inhales]

01:00:07.895 --> 01:00:08.771
[sighs]

01:00:11.733 --> 01:00:12.650
Ung.

01:00:14.485 --> 01:00:15.528
Funny, right?

01:00:17.405 --> 01:00:18.615
How could he…

01:00:21.451 --> 01:00:23.202
just abandon me like that?

01:00:24.996 --> 01:00:27.248
["Home" by Janet Suhh playing]

01:00:28.833 --> 01:00:30.501
[sobbing]

01:00:35.673 --> 01:00:37.967
[crying loudly]

01:01:02.075 --> 01:01:04.077
["Home" by Janet Suhh continues]
